This code initializes pigpio, sets up a circular buffer for storing the last 10 readings, and continuously samples the Honeywell SS49E sensor via an ADS1115 ADC on I2C bus 1. It converts the raw ADC value to magnetic field strength in Gauss, logs readings and threshold events via syslog, and drives GPIO27 HIGH when the rolling average exceeds the threshold. The program handles errors, skips failed samples, and properly cleans up resources on SIGINT/SIGTERM.

