This code sets up a Raspberry Pi Zero W to periodically read differential pressure and temperature from a Sensirion SDP31 sensor using the pigpio library. It handles I2C communication with retries and exponential backoff, logs the data to a file, and cleans up resources on exit. The main loop is interrupted by SIGINT (Ctrl+C) and SIGTERM signals, allowing for a clean exit.

