This code sets up an I2C communication with the Adafruit Si7021 sensor, reads temperature and humidity data, verifies the CRC checksum, and logs the data to a CSV file every 5 seconds. It handles errors, resets the sensor when necessary, and cleans up resources properly. The SIGINT/SIGTERM handler is not explicitly implemented in this snippet, but you can add it using signal(SIGINT, handler) and signal(SIGTERM, handler) in your main function.

