Please note that you need to install the pigpio library and the json-c library to compile and run this code. Also, ensure that the BMP280 sensor is properly connected to the Raspberry Pi's I2C bus (SDA=GPIO2/pin3, SCL=GPIO3/pin5) at address 0x76.

