This code initializes the I2C interface, checks for the presence of the LIS3MDL magnetometer, and continuously reads and processes magnetic field data. It also includes error handling, retries on initialization failure, and clean exit on SIGINT/SIGTERM. The sensor's output is appended to 'magnetic_log.txt' at 10 Hz, and a threshold alert is printed to stderr when the total field magnitude exceeds 800 mG.

