This code initializes GPIO, BH1750 sensor, and I2C communication, sets up relay buttons, reads lux values, and drives the relays based on lux thresholds. It logs the timestamp, lux value, and relay states to `lighting_log.txt` every second. The code handles errors for I2C and file I/O operations and releases all resources on exit. It also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals for clean termination.

