This code initializes the Keywish KY-022 sensor on GPIO16 (BCM) and the Songle SRD-05VDC-SL relay module on GPIO20 (BCM) using libgpiod. It continuously monitors the sensor for an obstacle (active-low), and upon detection, toggles the relay state. The new relay state and a timestamp are logged to `relay_events.log`. The program handles errors for GPIO initialization, sensor read, and log file write, and exits cleanly on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

