This code initializes pigpio, sets up GPIO17 as an input with pull-up, registers an alert callback for falling edges, and decodes NEC IR signals. It validates the checksum, logs decoded commands to syslog, and publishes them to an MQTT broker at localhost:1883 on topic ir/decoded. The program handles errors, cleans up resources on SIGINT or SIGTERM, and uses modern libraries (pigpio and paho-mqtt v2).

